---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About" description="IONIC is a Nairobi-based data analytics and business intelligence company founded to serve East African organizations that are data-rich but insight-poor.">

  <section class="page-hero section-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label" style="color:var(--cyan);">About IONIC</p>
      <h1 style="color:var(--white); max-width:640px;">Built in Nairobi. Built for East Africa.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container about-grid">
      <div class="about-text">
        <p class="section-label">The Company</p>
        <h2 style="margin-bottom:16px;">Data analytics and intelligence — on a retainer, not on request.</h2>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <p>IONIC is a data analytics and business intelligence company based in Kenya, built to serve organizations across East Africa that are data-rich but insight-poor.</p>
        <p>The core premise is straightforward: most SMEs, financial institutions, and NGOs generate significant operational data every day — from loan repayments and sales figures to inventory movements and project outcomes — but lack the tools, skills, or bandwidth to turn that data into decisions.</p>
        <p>IONIC bridges that gap. We take raw, often scattered data and transform it into clear, actionable intelligence — delivered through dashboards, automated reports, predictive models, and AI-driven workflows that clients can actually use.</p>
        <p>We operate as a <strong>platform provider, not a one-off consultancy</strong>. We don't build dashboards on request and disappear. We embed ourselves in a client's operations on a retainer basis, becoming a recurring fixture in how they monitor performance, catch problems early, and plan ahead.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-sidebar">
        <div class="founder-card">
          <div class="founder-avatar">
            <div class="avatar-placeholder">IV</div>
          </div>
          <h3>Ivan</h3>
          <p class="founder-title">Founder & Lead Analyst</p>
          <p class="founder-bio">Ivan is a data analytics professional based in Nairobi with deep expertise in Power BI, Python, and business intelligence architecture. He founded IONIC to bring enterprise-grade data infrastructure to East African organizations that have historically had to manage without it.</p>
          <p class="founder-bio">His background spans financial services, manufacturing, and NGO data engagements — giving IONIC practical, sector-tested experience across the client tiers it serves.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label" style="text-align:center;">Our Approach</p>
      <h2 style="text-align:center; max-width:560px; margin:0 auto 48px;">Three principles that define how we work.</h2>
      <div class="principles-grid">
        <div class="principle-card">
          <div class="principle-num">01</div>
          <h3>Platform, not project</h3>
          <p>Every engagement is designed to be ongoing. We build data infrastructure that grows with your organization — not dashboards that collect dust after delivery.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="principle-card">
          <div class="principle-num">02</div>
          <h3>Actionable, not academic</h3>
          <p>Our models and dashboards are built to drive decisions, not to impress. If a client can't act on what we build, we haven't done our job.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="principle-card">
          <div class="principle-num">03</div>
          <h3>Regional depth</h3>
          <p>We understand the East African regulatory environment, market structure, and data realities — from SASRA compliance to M-Pesa transaction data. That context is our advantage.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-dark" style="text-align:center;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 style="color:var(--white); max-width:480px; margin:0 auto 16px;">Ready to work with us?</h2>
      <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75); max-width:400px; margin:0 auto 36px;">Get in touch and we will talk through what an IONIC engagement looks like for your organization.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-white">Talk to Us</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
<style>
.page-hero { padding: 80px 0 72px; }
.about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 380px; gap: 64px; align-items: start; }
.about-text p { margin-bottom: 16px; }
.about-text strong { color: var(--teal-dark); }
.founder-card { background: var(--off-white); border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 32px; text-align: center; }
.founder-avatar { margin-bottom: 16px; display: flex; justify-content: center; }
.avatar-placeholder { width: 72px; height: 72px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--teal-mid); color: var(--white); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.founder-card h3 { color: var(--teal-dark); margin-bottom: 4px; }
.founder-title { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--teal-mid); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.founder-bio { font-size: 0.88rem; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: left; }
.principles-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
.principle-card { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 32px; }
.principle-num { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--teal-bright); letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.principle-card h3 { color: var(--teal-dark); margin-bottom: 10px; }
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>
